== Description ==

'''Solar Panel''' is an electronic component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 2 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Solar Generator]], [[Solar Battery]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

